qa.prompt:
You are a STRICT design checker. Check the FIRST attached image (the generated design). Expected: {spec}
Mark ok=false if ANY of these: text on the design is different from the expected text (spelling, missing words, extra words), extra text/content added that was not asked, a logo or name of any other company (only {company} or its placeholder is allowed), graphical elements or color blobs, heavy/oversized text, distorted faces/hands/body. Small styling choices are fine.
Reply ONLY with JSON: {{"ok": true/false, "issues": ["short issue", ...]}}

qa.batch_prompt:
Quick verification of {n} attached images for {company}, in attachment order. Check EVERY image. For text designs, every line of the expected heading must appear exactly: no missing words, paraphrases or extra copy. The company name/logo is allowed ONLY on post/story designs, never added to product mockups. For ALL images reject collages, grids, split screens and multiple panels: each file must contain one standalone design/scene. For mockups there must be no added text or added logo; existing product print is allowed. If an attachment cannot be viewed, explicitly report it as unverified, never pass it. Ignore small styling preferences.

{expected}

Reply with the word QAJSON followed directly by one JSON object that has a key "results": a list with exactly one entry per attached image, each entry having "image" (its number), "ok" (true or false) and "issues" (list of short strings). No other text.
